<rml>
<head>
<title>Shooting range</title>
<style>
body, div, h1 { display: block; }
body { margin: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; font-family: body; font-size: 15px; color: #f0f5ed; }
.panel { position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 24px; width: 286px; padding: 18px; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #13252ee8; border-width: 1px; border-color: #49666c; pointer-events: auto; }
.eyebrow { color: #ebbf77; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
h1 { font-family: heading; font-size: 28px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 12px 0; }
#range-score { color: #9be4c5; font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
#range-status { color: #c7d8d9; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.buttons { display: flex; margin-top: 8px; }
button { display: block; tab-index: auto; box-sizing: border-box; width: 48%; margin-right: 4%; padding: 11px 8px; font-family: body; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; color: #eff8f2; background-color: #365962; border-width: 1px; border-color: #65868b; }
button:hover, button:focus { background-color: #48747b; border-color: #b3e2d4; }
button.selected { background-color: #557961; border-color: #9be4c5; }
button:disabled { color: #889d9f; background-color: #253f48; }
.instructions { position: absolute; bottom: 24px; left: 24px; padding: 12px 16px; background-color: #13252ee8; font-size: 13px; color: #c7d8d9; line-height: 1.5; }
#range-crosshair { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 22px; height: 22px; margin-left: -11px; margin-top: -11px; }
.horizontal { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 10px; width: 22px; height: 2px; background-color: #efffe8; }
.vertical { position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 0; width: 2px; height: 22px; background-color: #efffe8; }
#range-crosshair.complete .horizontal, #range-crosshair.complete .vertical { background-color: #78e5af; }
@media (max-width: 700px) { .panel { top: 76px; right: 12px; width: 230px; max-height: 30%; overflow-y: auto; padding: 12px; } h1 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px; } #range-score { font-size: 16px; } .instructions { bottom: 10px; left: 12px; right: 12px; font-size: 11px; padding: 8px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="panel">
    <div class="eyebrow">SHOWCASE / AIM &amp; HIT</div>
    <h1>Shooting range</h1>
    <div id="range-score">0 / 3 targets · 0 shots</div>
    <div id="range-status">Near target ahead, far target left, covered target right. Move around the blue wall.</div>
    <div class="buttons">
        <button id="range-fire">Fire</button>
        <button id="range-reset">Reset targets</button>
    </div>
    <div class="buttons">
        <button id="range-ray" class="selected">Ray</button>
        <button id="range-sphere">Sphere 0.12 m</button>
    </div>
</div>
<div id="range-crosshair"><div class="horizontal"></div><div class="vertical"></div></div>
<div class="instructions">WASD move · Hold right mouse to look · Left click fires at the crosshair<br/>Space jump · Tab switches view · R resets targets · Touch: move/look zones + Fire</div>
</body>
</rml>
